        "text": "### Result\n{\n  \"state\": \"prog-lang:L3:W0.9:true, sys-design:L2:W0.8:true, problem-solve:L4:W1:false, collab:L3:W0.7999999999999999:true, code-review:L2:W0.6:true, agile:L2:W0.5:true\",\n  \"summary\": \"Software Engineer\\nEngineering\\n6 competencies\\nExport\\nShare\\nSave\\nCoverage\\n49%\\nof model\\nAvg Level\\n2.4\\nBeginner\\nCritical Path\\n4\\ncompetencies\\nProgramming Languages\\nSystem Design\\nCollaboration\\n+1\\nRisk Gaps\\n1\\nidentified\\nSystem Design\\nCompetency Gap Alert\\n1 competency below recommended level: System Design. Consider increasing training focus or adjusting e\"\n}\n### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.evaluate('() => {\\n  const root=document.getElementById(\\'root\\');\\n  let fiber=root[Object.keys(root).find(k=>k.startsWith(\\'__reactContainer$\\'))];\\n  let res=null;\\n  const visit=(f,d)=>{ if(!f||d>60||res) return; if(f.type&&f.type.name===\\'ModelDetailView\\'){ let hs=f.memoizedState,i=0; while(hs&&i<20){const st=hs.memoizedState; if(st&&st.competencies){res=st.competencies.map(c=>c.id+\\':L\\'+c.level+\\':W\\'+c.weight+\\':\\'+c.enabled).join(\\', \\'); return;} hs=hs.next;i++;} } visit(f.child,d+1); visit(f.sibling,d); };\\n  visit(fiber,0);\\n  const t=document.querySelector(\\'main\\').innerText;\\n  return {state:res, summary: t.split(\\'Programming Languages\\\\n\\\\nProficiency\\')[0].slice(0,350)};\\n}');\n```"
      }
    ]
